<%@ page contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%!
private String esc(Object value) {
  if (value == null) return "";
  return value.toString().replace("&","&amp;").replace("<","&lt;").replace(">","&gt;").replace("\"","&quot;").replace("'","&#x27;");
}
%>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>CampusDesk · Dashboard</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/assets/app.css"></head>
<body><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/"><span class="brand-icon">C</span><span>CampusDesk<small>STUDENT SYSTEM</small></span></a><nav><a class="active" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/">▦ &nbsp; Overview</a><a href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/students">♙ &nbsp; Students</a><a href="#modules">▤ &nbsp; Academic modules</a></nav><div class="side-note"><span class="dot"></span> Database project <small>Java · JDBC · MySQL</small></div></aside>
<main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div><p class="eyebrow">CAMPUS ADMINISTRATION</p><h1>Dashboard</h1><p class="muted">A clearer view of your academic records.</p></div><a class="button" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/students">Manage students <span>↗</span></a></header>
<section class="welcome"><div><p class="eyebrow light">STUDENT INFORMATION SYSTEM</p><h2>Everything organized.<br>One campus at a time.</h2><p>Manage student records and keep essential academic data in one place.</p><a class="button button-light" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/students">Open student directory →</a></div><div class="welcome-art"><div class="orb orb-one"></div><div class="orb orb-two"></div><div class="mini-card"><span>ACADEMIC YEAR</span><strong>2026—27</strong><small>Student records workspace</small></div></div></section>
<section class="stats"><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Total students</span><span class="stat-icon purple">♙</span></div><strong><%=request.getAttribute("studentCount")==null?"—":esc(request.getAttribute("studentCount"))%></strong><small>Records in the database</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Departments</span><span class="stat-icon orange">▦</span></div><strong><%=request.getAttribute("departmentCount")==null?"—":esc(request.getAttribute("departmentCount"))%></strong><small>Academic departments</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Database status</span><span class="stat-icon green">✓</span></div><strong class="status-text">Connected</strong><small>Live values from MySQL</small></article></section>
<section class="section-head" id="modules"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE</p><h2>Academic modules</h2><p class="muted">Your project is structured to grow with your requirements.</p></div></section><section class="module-grid"><a class="module-card" href="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/students"><span class="module-icon purple">♙</span><h3>Student directory</h3><p>Add, find, update and remove student records.</p><span class="module-link">Open directory ↗</span></a><article class="module-card planned"><span class="module-icon orange">▤</span><h3>Courses & enrolments</h3><p>Relational tables are ready for the next module.</p><span class="module-link">Database schema ready</span></article><article class="module-card planned"><span class="module-icon green">◷</span><h3>Attendance & marks</h3><p>Attendance, assessments and marks are modelled.</p><span class="module-link">Database schema ready</span></article></section><footer>CampusDesk · Student Management System <span>Built with Java, JDBC & MySQL</span></footer></main></body></html>